  "goodToKnow": "Das Raumschiff is a spaceship: ein bemanntes Raumschiff. Star Trek ran in German as Raumschiff Enterprise, and the 1970s German series Raumpatrouille Orion is a cult classic. Der Raum means space and room: der Weltraum, das Wohnzimmer is a Raum too. Die Raumstation is a space station, and die Raumfahrt space travel. The German Aerospace Center (DLR) trains astronauts in Cologne. Plural: die Raumschiffe."
